    "review.dall-e-3.the.killer.feature.conversational.prompting": "The killer feature? Conversational prompting. Instead of learning prompt syntax, you simply tell ChatGPT what you want: \"Create a futuristic cityscape at sunset with flying cars.\" ChatGPT then expands your idea into a detailed prompt and generates 1-2 images in ~30 seconds.",
