    "review.dall-e-3.safety.filters.strong.content.moderation": "सुरक्षा फिल्टर: मजबूत सामग्री मॉडरेशन (कोई NSFW, हिंसा, कॉपीराइट वर्ण)",
    "review.dall-e-3.better.prompt.adherence.follows.complex": "Better prompt adherence: Follows complex instructions more accurately",
